# Vercel CLI preview uploads (`vercel deploy`) send the working directory and do NOT honour .gitignore.
# Past: a forbidden production upload (`vercel --prod`) tried to upload .claude/worktrees/ — ~124 GB
# of per-worktree node_modules — and failed with "Request body too large. Limit: 10mb".
#
# Git deploys of main build server-side from the repo and were never affected.
# This ignore still matters for a preview upload. Production CLI uploads are forbidden.
# Tracked files under .claude/ (agents, commands, settings) are NOT needed by the build.
.claude/
node_modules
.next
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
.tmp-probe/
